<title>UK: Granada sells Hyde Park hotel for 86 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Granada sells Hyde Park hotel for 86 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granada Group Plc said on Tuesday it has sold the Hyde Park Hotel to a subsidiary of Mandarin Oriental International Ltd for 86 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>The media and leisure group announced in May that it was selling 17 exclusive hotels, acquired from Forte Plc in a 3.9 billion stg takeover in January.</p>
<p>Analysts expect the sale to raise a total of 800 to 900 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
